    "body": "Can you do it in a custom command like so?\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[custom.git_minus]\r\ncommand = \"git diff --numstat | cut -f2 | paste -sd+ - | bc\"\r\nwhen = \"[[ $(git diff --numstat) ]]\"\r\nsymbol = \"-\"\r\nstyle = \"red\"\r\n\r\n\r\n[custom.git_plus]\r\ncommand = \"git diff --numstat | cut -f1 | paste -sd+ - | bc\"\r\nwhen = \"[[ $(git diff --numstat) ]]\"\r\nsymbol = \"+\"\r\nstyle = \"green\"\r\n```",
